         "name": "FAQ-Updated",
         "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
         "actions": [
            "view",
            "update",
            "create",
            "delete",
            "download"
         ]
      }
      """
    When the Resource Admin updates the Resource Type
    Then the Resource Type updated successfully with response code 200
    And return the updated resource type
      """json
      {
         "key": "FAQ-3",
         "name": "FAQ-Updated",
         "description": "Frequently Asked Question",
